# Semantic fix-confirm — do today's three fixes (imports into synthesis,
# javac UTF-8, silent-survivor cap) recover the sem8_v2 regressions?
#   - Lang-7, Math-2 overfits: were TP in earlier batches (diag_A, mined54_B),
#     went FN in sem8_v2 under 3 injected silent contracts. silent-cap should
#     recover them to TP.
#   - Chart-26: the imports fix should end the org.jfree.ui compile waste; the
#     correct leg was a FP (invented metamorphic oracle) — watch if it recurs.
# Both legs (o + c) per bug so precision and recall both register.
#   ./run_suite.sh fixconfirm suites/fixconfirm.cases
MODEL="gpt-5.4"
COMMON="-n 3 -m 8 --fuzz_timeout 20 --verify_timeout 20 --verify_relations --synthesize_relations --replay_relations_on_patched"
CASES=(
  # Lang-7/Arja o-leg EXCLUDED 2026-07-16: measured extensionally identical
